usage: aeep-toolkit [-h]
                    {list,plan,doctor,report,export-preview,trace-preview,install-plan,install,remove,candidate,discover,import-report,eval,repository-recipe,selection-report} ...

positional arguments:
  {list,plan,doctor,report,export-preview,trace-preview,install-plan,install,remove,candidate,discover,import-report,eval,repository-recipe,selection-report}
    doctor              Read project connection metadata without starting
                        services
    report              Summarize normalized records without executing an
                        evaluator
    export-preview      Prepare a minimized local sharing document; never
                        publishes
    trace-preview       Prepare minimized OTLP/HTTP JSON from a receipt; no
                        exporter or network
    install-plan        Review a selected closure of local wheels; no writes
                        or execution
    install             Operator-only private runtime installation/removal
    remove              Operator-only private runtime installation/removal
    candidate           Inspect exact local skill payload without executing or
                        installing it
    discover            Search explicitly configured sources and retain
                        provenance; never install candidates
    import-report       Read upstream observations; never execute software or
                        qualify claims
    eval                Run an explicitly selected existing evaluation backend
    repository-recipe   Export a reviewed repository recipe definition; never
                        executes code
    selection-report    Score supplied policy decisions; never grants
                        admission

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
